---
import PrimaryCta from "./PrimaryCta.astro";
---

<section id="how" class="scroll-mt-6 bg-ink px-5 py-16 sm:px-8 sm:py-20 lg:px-12 lg:py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1600px]">
    <p class="text-[0.66rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.13em] text-lime uppercase">How it works</p>
    <h2
      class="mt-3 max-w-[16ch] text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.25rem)] leading-[0.9] font-bold tracking-[-0.04em] text-cloud uppercase"
    >
      After every run, the plan moves.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-[#d6ded6] sm:text-base">
      A training plan that adapts after every run—so you always know what to run next, and why.
    </p>

    <ol class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8">
      <li class="border-t border-white/12 pt-5">
        <p class="text-[0.66rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.13em] text-lime uppercase">01</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-cloud">Start your plan</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-mist">
          Set a goal. Get today's run—not a static calendar that ignores real life.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-t border-white/12 pt-5">
        <p class="text-[0.66rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.13em] text-lime uppercase">02</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-cloud">Run it</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-mist">
          Complete the session, cut it short, or skip. What actually happened is the input.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-t border-white/12 pt-5">
        <p class="text-[0.66rem] font-semibold tracking-[0.13em] text-lime uppercase">03</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-semibold text-cloud">The plan adapts</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-mist">
          Next up is rebuilt around that result, so you know what to run next, and why.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <p class="mt-10">
      <PrimaryCta />
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
